      "text": "> Loosely coupled here means ki pehle frontend hum backend k server pr hi serve kr rhe the ab hum using react frontend bhi alag krdiya \n\n> Component based meant ki react mein sb functions likh rhe honge jo html return krenge\n\n> JSX = Javascript XML\n\n> JSX files hongi . so basically 'extensible' comes from xml(extensible markup language) ye bilkul html jaisi hi hai . so html+js = jsx here.\n\n> Single page application banane mein help krta hai i.e., page refresh nhi hoga .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> Loosely coupled here means ki pehle frontend hum backend k server pr hi serve kr rhe the ab hum using react frontend bhi alag krdiya \n\n> Component based meant ki react mein sb functions likh rhe honge jo html return krenge\n\n> JSX = Javascript XML\n\n> JSX files hongi . so basically 'extensible' comes from xml(extensible markup language) ye bilkul html jaisi hi hai . so html+js = jsx here.\n\n> Single page application banane mein help krta hai i.e., page refresh nhi hoga .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
