      "updated": 1764011690932,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟢 1️⃣ Chattiness\n\nDefinition:\n\nChattiness refers to making many small requests between the client and server to get data.\n\nExample:\n\nA web page calls the API 10 times to load 10 pieces of data instead of 1 request for all.\n\nPros:\n\nEasier to debug each small request\n\nCan cache small responses individually\n\nCons:\n\nHigh latency because of multiple network round-trips\n\nSlower page load for users\n\nAnalogy:\n\nLike sending 10 short text messages instead of 1 longer message.\n\n🟢 2️⃣ Chunkiness\n\nDefinition:\n\nChunkiness refers to sending fewer requests with more data in each request.\n\nExample:\n\nOne API call returns all 10 pieces of data at once.\n\nPros:\n\nReduces network latency\n\nFaster overall response for the user\n\nCons:\n\nHarder to debug big payloads\n\nLarger payloads may consume more memory\n\nAnalogy:\n\nLike sending 1 long email instead of 10 short texts.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟢 1️⃣ Chattiness\n\nDefinition:\n\nChattiness refers to making many small requests between the client and server to get data.\n\nExample:\n\nA web page calls the API 10 times to load 10 pieces of data instead of 1 request for all.\n\nPros:\n\nEasier to debug each small request\n\nCan cache small responses individually\n\nCons:\n\nHigh latency because of multiple network round-trips\n\nSlower page load for users\n\nAnalogy:\n\nLike sending 10 short text messages instead of 1 longer message.\n\n🟢 2️⃣ Chunkiness\n\nDefinition:\n\nChunkiness refers to sending fewer requests with more data in each request.\n\nExample:\n\nOne API call returns all 10 pieces of data at once.\n\nPros:\n\nReduces network latency\n\nFaster overall response for the user\n\nCons:\n\nHarder to debug big payloads\n\nLarger payloads may consume more memory\n\nAnalogy:\n\nLike sending 1 long email instead of 10 short texts.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
